-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §32 ערך שעה ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה: §15
-- applies to teaching employees to whom the reform is applied in part, with
-- the hours of §15(ב)'s divisor — 40 — replaced: for a teacher by 30, 32
-- and 36 in תשע"ב–תשע"ד, and for a principal, for an hour of absence, by
-- 37, 38 and 39.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-15`
IMPORT `oz-founding-26`
IMPORT `oz-founding-30`

§ `32 ערך שעה ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה`

DECLARE `whose hour value section 32 changes` IS ONE OF
    `a teacher in part application`
    `a principal in part application`

DECLARE `what the Oz hour value is for` IS ONE OF
    `pay for a substitution hour`
    `the deduction for an hour of absence`

-- ¶1–¶2: §15 applies to teaching employees to whom the reform is applied in
-- part, but in §15(ב) "40 (שעות)" gives way to (א) for a teacher: 30 in
-- תשע"ב, 32 in תשע"ג, 36 in תשע"ד; (ב) for a principal, "לעניין שעת
-- היעדרות": 37, 38, 39. For a principal's hour for any other purpose §32
-- puts nothing in place of the 40 (NOTHING), and §15(ב)'s 40 stands. The
-- base the hours divide is §15(א)'s, unchanged.
@ref akn:art_32/p1 akn:art_32/p2
GIVEN k IS A `whose hour value section 32 changes`, use IS A `what the Oz hour value is for`, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours section 32 puts in place of 40 for` k use y IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `a teacher in part application` THEN `by the year of part application` y 30 32 36
    WHEN `a principal in part application` THEN
        IF use EQUALS `the deduction for an hour of absence`
        THEN `by the year of part application` y 37 38 39
        ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN k IS A `whose hour value section 32 changes`, use IS A `what the Oz hour value is for`, y IS A NUMBER
      `the base of a full position` IS A NUMBER @desc §15(א)'s base, at a full position
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hour value in part application` k use y `the base of a full position` IS
    `the base of a full position` DIVIDED BY (`weeks in a month, for the hour value` TIMES hours)
    WHERE
        hours MEANS fromMaybe 40 (`the hours section 32 puts in place of 40 for` k use y)

§§ `32 -- illustrations`

-- A base of 12,990 buys an hour of 100 in תשע"ב (4.33 × 30); under §15(ב)'s
-- 40 it would buy 75.
#ASSERT `the hour value in part application` `a teacher in part application` `pay for a substitution hour` `the school year 5772` 12990 EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `the Oz hour value` 12990 EQUALS 75
#ASSERT `the hours section 32 puts in place of 40 for` `a principal in part application` `pay for a substitution hour` `the school year 5772` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the hour value in part application` `a principal in part application` `pay for a substitution hour` `the school year 5772` 17320 EQUALS `the Oz hour value` 17320
-- the hours are §26(א)'s week for a teacher and §30(א)'s base for a
-- principal, year by year
#ASSERT all (GIVEN y YIELD `the hours section 32 puts in place of 40 for` `a teacher in part application` `pay for a substitution hour` y EQUALS `the hours of the full-position week in part application in` y) (LIST `the school year 5772`, `the school year 5773`, `the school year 5774`)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN y YIELD `the hours section 32 puts in place of 40 for` `a principal in part application` `the deduction for an hour of absence` y EQUALS `the Oz principal's position base in part application in` y) (LIST `the school year 5772`, `the school year 5773`, `the school year 5774`)
